          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger Veshumirix is targeted with an attack.\nEffect Veshumirix raises his wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If Veshumirix is Flying, he descends 10 feet after the attack.",
