          "name": "Demonic Condemnation",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The target must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:22) save or become Frightened 2 (Frightened 4 on a critical failure). The target is Enfeebled 1 for as long as it is frightened.",
