    "source": {
      "sourcePack": "extinction-curse-bestiary",
      "sourceId": "4Abc5gg8ac5ixGx1",
      "slug": "hallowed-wheel",
      "publicationTitle": "Pathfinder #152: Legacy of the Lost God",
      "license": "OGL",
      "remaster": false
    },
    "image": {
      "path": "/api/game-systems/pathfinder-2e/icons/default-icons/hazard.svg"
    },
    "sourceHash": "sha256:70d3fae1f634e101a3a9b419a45ff29e40d8169b0235f7693ac577545aab7ca2",
    "translatableHash": "sha256:d451dbdf422722d3a9fb7740ae4f39e7a835b41de9686349bd066c9474c8b49c",
    "data": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "entryType": "HAZARD",
      "name": "Hallowed Wheel",
      "level": 10,
      "rarity": "rare",
      "size": "medium",
      "traits": [
        "magical",
        "mechanical",
        "trap"
      ],
      "description": "An ornate wheel, divided into eight segments with a rune painted on each, is mounted on a pole and controlled by a lever that can be triggered manually or a sensor that detects creatures within 30 feet in front of it.",
      "armorClass": 30,
      "hitPoints": 80,
      "hardness": 16,
      "stealth": {
        "modifier": 19,
        "details": "(expert) to detect the magical sensor; noticing the wheel has a DC of 0"
      },
      "disable": "check (thievery, dc:31, name:Flip the switch, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap) (master) on the wheel to flip the switch returning it to a harmless carnival game, check (thievery, dc:26, name:Erase each rune, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap) (expert) to erase each rune, or Dispel Magic (5th rank; counteract DC 28) to counteract each rune.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(2 actions) On its initiative, the trap uses its first action to spin, then stops. Roll 1d8 to determine which segment is topmost when the wheel stops spinning. The wheel uses its second action to replicate the spell listed for that segment (5th level, DC 27, spell attack roll +17). This spell's target is centered on or otherwise includes the nearest creature in the spell's area. This increases the spell's range to 30 feet if necessary. Any spell cast by this trap is occult.\n1 - Black Tentacles 20-foot burst 1d20+17\n2 - Blindness check (fortitude, dc:27, name:Blindness, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,incapacitation,necromancy,occult)\n3 - Confusion check (will, dc:27, name:Confusion, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,emotion,enchantment,mental,occult)\n4 - Death Ward Range 30 feet\n5 - Outcast's Curse check (will, dc:27, name:Outcast's Curse, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,curse,enchantment,mental,misfortune,occult) Range 30 feet\n6 - Shadow Blast 30-foot line check (reflex, dc:27, basic, name:Shadow Blast, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,evocation,occult,shadow) or check (will, dc:27, basic, name:Shadow Blast, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,evocation,occult,shadow) 5d8 force damage\n7 - Noise Blast 10-foot burst check (fortitude, dc:27, name:Sound Burst, traits:hazard,complex,magical,mechanical,trap,evocation,occult,sonic) 2d10 sonic damage\n8 - Gecko Grip Range 30 feet",
      "reset": "The trap deactivates and resets if 1 minute passes without any creature moving within range of its sensor.",
      "saves": {
        "fortitude": 21,
        "reflex": 15,
        "will": 0
      },
      "defenses": {
        "immunities": [
          "critical-hits",
          "precision"
        ],
        "resistances": [],
        "weaknesses": []
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "Stv3Oe7QU577Gke1",
          "name": "Wheel Spin",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature pulls the lever or enters the sensor's detection area\nEffect The wheel begins to spin and rolls initiative.",
          "traits": []
        }
      ]
    },
