    "contentId": "pf2e:bestiary:extinction-curse-bestiary:mask-of-arodens-guises",
    "domain": "BESTIARY",
    "locale": "en-US",
    "source": {
      "sourcePack": "extinction-curse-bestiary",
      "sourceId": "mTQYkgy9lfrv2yGG",
      "slug": "mask-of-arodens-guises",
      "publicationTitle": "Pathfinder #152: Legacy of the Lost God",
      "license": "OGL",
      "remaster": false
    },
    "image": {
      "path": "/api/game-systems/pathfinder-2e/icons/default-icons/hazard.svg"
    },
    "sourceHash": "sha256:5ac2d6994f9095e6ed543f7fb52b83287352fb581d7eddec1263a6a3888d397b",
    "translatableHash": "sha256:9cc0af5dbbb0e3ab53a457f91c5f05e9ecf65d79df6665e59d0b9fcbd3125345",
    "data": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "entryType": "HAZARD",
      "name": "Mask of Aroden's Guises",
      "level": 10,
      "rarity": "rare",
      "size": "medium",
      "traits": [
        "magical",
        "trap"
      ],
      "description": "Ten masks adorn twelve stone statues.",
      "armorClass": 30,
      "hitPoints": 48,
      "hardness": 18,
      "stealth": {
        "modifier": 20,
        "details": "(expert)"
      },
      "disable": "check (religion, dc:29, name:Dismiss the magic, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap) (expert) or check (occultism, dc:29, name:Dismiss the magic, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap) or check (thievery, dc:31, name:Dismiss the magic, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap) (expert) to dismiss the magic on a single statue. Replacing the two missing masks (a mask made of or incorporating coins on the merchant statue and a mask made of any valuable fabric on the tailor statue) and succeeding at a check (religion, dc:27, name:Disarm the trap, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap) check disarms the trap.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(3 actions) An unmasked statue casts Phantasmal Killer (check (will, dc:27, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap,death,emotion,fear,illusion,mental) and check (fortitude, dc:27, traits:hazard,complex,magical,trap,death,emotion,fear,illusion,mental,incapacitation)) against a target in the room for each of the trap's actions, creating an image of the statue lunging forth. It doesn't affect the same creature more than once; if there are fewer targets than it has actions, the trap doesn't use its remaining actions. Unmasking an additional statue increases the hazard's actions by 1, and replacing a mask reduces its actions by 1.",
      "reset": "The trap deactivates and resets 1 minute after it has no target creatures",
      "saves": {
        "fortitude": 20,
        "reflex": 16,
        "will": 0
      },
      "defenses": {
        "immunities": [
          "critical-hits",
          "precision"
        ],
        "resistances": [],
        "weaknesses": []
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "wcALGN4qxbG1E6A4",
          "name": "Unmasked Statues",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature removes the mask from a statue\nEffect The trap casts Phantasmal Killer (DC 27) against the creature, creating an image of the statue lunging forth. The trap then rolls initiative.",
          "traits": [
            "occult"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
