          "id": "jajMdZuaov0LtkBl",
          "name": "Call to Halt",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Andera makes an check (intimidation) check and compares it to the Will DC of each creature she chooses within 30 feet. Regardless of her result, the targets are temporarily immune for 10 minutes.\nCritical Success The target is Paralyzed for 1 minute and becomes Frightened 2.\nSuccess The target takes a –10-foot penalty to all its Speeds for 1 minute and becomes Frightened 1.\nEffect: Call to Halt (Success)",
