          "id": "hgAe4LDV9pOetFnG",
          "name": "Eerie Flexibility",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Despite her size, Helg's multiple joints allow her to fit through tight spaces as if she were a Medium creature. While Squeezing, she can move at her full Speed.",
