          "name": "Flurry of Blows",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Shristi makes two unarmed Strikes. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purposes of resistances and weaknesses. He applies his multiple attack penalty to the Strikes normally.\nAs it has the flourish trait, Shristi can use Flurry of Blows only once per turn.",
