          "name": "Bloody Sneak Attack",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Any creature taking Persistent Bleed Damage is Off-Guard against the Skinner's attacks. When attacking an off-guard creature, the Skinner deals an additional 2d6 precision damage.",
