          "name": "Spell-Imbued Blade",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The svartalfar killer chooses Acid Splash, Ignition, Enfeeble, or Shocking Grasp and makes a melee Strike.\nIf the svartalfar killer hits, they cast the chosen spell through the weapon at the same target. The spell's attack roll is the same result as the Strike.",
