          "name": "Dirty Bomb",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The chemist has at least one bomb in their possession\nEffect The chemist adds a hasty mix of noxious substances to the bomb and makes a ranged Strike with it. If it hits and deals damage, the target must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:27) save or become Stupefied 2 for 1d6; if the result of the save is a critical failure, this increases to Stupefied 3. For the next 24 hours, the affected target takes a -2 circumstance penalty (-3 on a critical failure) to additional Fortitude saving throws against the same chemist's Crude Bombs.\nEffect: Dirty Bomb\nEffect: Dirty Bomb (Critical Failure)",
