          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The bregdi pulls a creature it can reach or a creature holding something it can reach (such as a fishing line in the water).\nThe bregdi attempts an check (athletics, defense:fortitude) check against the creature's Fortitude DC. On a success, it pulls the creature into an adjacent space. On a critical success, the bregdi can also make a jaws Strike against the creature pulled into an adjacent space.",
