          "description": "Frequency once per day\nRequirements Scathka hasn't acted yet on their turn\nEffect On their turn, Scathka casts one spell they've prepared and already cast this day without spending a spell slot. Scathka must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements.",
