          "name": "Disgorge Portal",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The camarach vomits a spray of coruscating light. This has the effect of a DC 42 Prismatic Spray, except that each creature is affected by one violet beam and one other beam (roll 1d6 instead of 1d8 to determine which other beam).\nThe camarach can't Disgorge a Portal again for 1d4.",
