          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature critically fails a Strike against the Daemonic Rumormonger\nEffect The Rumormonger dodges out of the way and uses his momentum to attack and move out of reach. He Strides up to 20 feet and can Strike at any point during this movement; this Strike counts toward the multiple attack penalty on his next turn.",
