          "name": "Black Ink Delirium",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Saving Throw check (fortitude, dc:38)\nMaximum Duration 4 rounds\nStage 1 3d6 poison damage and Clumsy 2 (1 round)\nStage 2 6d6 poison damage and Confused (1 round)",
